      <h2>Why Choose EzYir Soya?</h2>
      <p>Soya is a rich, complete plant-based protein source containing essential amino acids and vital nutrients. At <strong>EzYir</strong>, we ensure all raw soya beans, soya meat, and chunks are ethically processed and packaged under strict sanitary conditions.</p>
    </article>

    <!-- Delivery & Event Services -->
    <article class="about-card">
      <h2>Delivery Services & Event Supply</h2>
      <p>Our service is to provide you with your chosen product or products wherever you need them. Simply place your order or call us, and we will deliver straight to your location:</p>
      <ul>
