        <li><strong>Events & Ceremonies:</strong> Bulk orders delivered for funerals, weddings, parties, and family gatherings.</li>
        <li><strong>Business Supply:</strong> Reliable deliveries to offices, restaurants, shops, and commercial places.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <!-- Location & Orders -->
