      <p>Call or place an order through our website to arrange fast and convenient delivery to your preferred site.</p>
    </article>

    <!-- Secure Transactions -->
    <article class="about-card">
      <h2>Secure Payment & Transactions</h2>
      <p>We offer a fast, reliable, and secure checkout experience powered by <strong>Paystack</strong>. You can pay conveniently using:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Mobile Money:</strong> Instant payments via MTN Mobile Money, Vodafone Cash, or AirtelTigo Money.</li>
        <li><strong>Debit/Credit Cards:</strong> Secure online card payments.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

  </main>

